- "I love my baby and i have never had any thought of hurting her in anyway! myself, yes! but I'm on medication and in therapy for this, but it's a long road and it isn't simple in the slightest, there's a lot of feelings and emotions and most importantly, hormones to battle with." [sr009-0016]
