- "I like to colour but I can’t colour. I like to paint but can’t paint. I like to make bracelets, I can’t do that. I put a show on and read, or go on my phone.those are the things I can do and easily involve her, or do while she contact naps. I have been told to include her in the painting and colouring but we do. She has her own painting and colouring time sometimes if I feel like cleaning up the mess, we do that together. […]" [sr022-0027]
