### What other people told them or did

- "And I feel ISOLATED. All my friends, all the forums, every random person I talk to in the store either won’t admit to it or doesn’t experience this. I hear “you’ll wish for it back, just enjoy,” or “oh my goodness I just don’t have time to be bored” (and that’s from a house of just ONE kid and a SAHM)." [sr004-0154]
- "If I could give you 10,000 thumbs up, I would. You’re totally right! It didn’t even occur to me that maybe he won’t need the same daycare schedule of activities + stimulation anymore. His teachers have informed me he gets overly tired and cranky at certain points throughout the day, too. Your advice will definitely help considering different options and managing our (free) time." [sr019-0019]
- "I went to the zoo today (detroit zoo) for the first time with him and it went great. My mother in law bought us a pass!" [sr020-0073]
